                    "message": "I assume you needed LogEntry 1_19 ? Or just used a recent one? \n\nEither is fine we should bump all our LogEntrys to this level since we use a mix :/ \n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/b934d565a45e35870df8ac2007060e814f71fdb3/redfish-core/lib/log_services.hpp#L326\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/b934d565a45e35870df8ac2007060e814f71fdb3/redfish-core/lib/log_services.hpp#L1796"
